t-size:18px; line-height:1.5em;\"><span style=\"color:#1c1c1c;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">1-2 large bunches of lacinato kale, stems removed and chopped coarsely</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em;\"><span style=\"color:#1c1c1c;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">4 cloves of minced fresh garlic</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em;\"><span style=\"color:#1c1c1c;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">1/2 cup chicken stock</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em;\"><span style=\"color:#1c1c1c;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">2 tablespoons olive oil</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em;\"><span style=\"color:#1c1c1c;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">1/4 teaspoon or more red pepper flakes</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em;\"><span style=\"color:#1c1c1c;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">salt &amp; pepper to taste</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em;\"><span style=\"color:#1c1c1c;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em;\">Serves 5 -10 as an appetizer or side dish<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\nServes 3 - 4 as an entree</p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jyn2gm4z":{"pinUrl":"https://www.pinterest.com/p