ize:18px;\">Heat a large deep skillet with a lid to medium heat. Add 1 tablespoon olive oil, garlic and pepper flakes then&nbsp;stir-fry for 30 seconds. Next&nbsp;add the kale,&nbsp;chicken stock and the rest of the olive oil. Stir, reduce the heat to medium low and cover with lid for 8-10 minutes.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">While the kale is cooking, heat a small heavy bottom pan such as cast iron or copper to medium heat for frying the halloumi. When the pan is hot, add the cheese and fry until nicely browned on one side then turn the cheese and fry the other side until browned. Set the pan off the heat until ready to serve.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Check the kale now to see if it&#39;s wilted to your taste. We like ours fairly sturdy and 10-15 minutes is often plenty. If you like your kale softer, let it steam, stirring occasionally, a few more minutes with the lid on.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">You can serve the cheese over the Tuscan kale in planks as I did, or you can dice it up like croutons for the&nbsp;warm salad.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">&nbsp;</p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jyn2gm8d":{"id":"comp-jyn2gm8d","appDefinitionId":"13016589-a9eb-424a-8a69-46cb05ce0b2c","widgetId":"130165ba-4eeb-4a87-3121-a3cf2a86d2ca","isAppInClientSpecMap":true,"isViewerMode":true,"isResponsive":false,"translations":{"preloaderOverlay":{"loading":"Loading"},"errorMessageOverlay":{"reloadText":"Refresh this page","oopsText":"App Didn't Load","installErrorText":"We Were Unable to Install This App","generalErrorPrefix":"Try again later, disable any ad blockers, or reload the page. Contact the author of","generalErrorSuffix":"for help.","uninstalledErrorText":"We Were Unable to Install This App"},"unavailableMessageOverlay":{"title":"Widget Didn’t Load","text1":"Check your internet and refresh this page.","text2":"If that doesn’t work, contact us.","reloadText":"Refresh this page"}},"applicationId":"2979"},"comp-jyn2gm9l":{"images":[{"quality":{},"link":{},"data-anchor":{},"uri":"b25591_24a35ec53c4a4d41a0da9c7b7cd6d2d3~mv2_d_3000_1965_s_2.jpg","alt":"","width":3000,"height":1965,"id":"dataItem-jyn2gm9w1","title":"Add a Title","type":"Image"},{"quality":{},"link":{},"data-anchor":{},"uri":"b25591_f1ab68320b444a4ca3cc0b7dd2284bf5~mv2_d_3000_4500_s_4_2.jpg","alt":"","width":3000,"height":4500,"id":"dataItem-jyn2gm9x","title":"Add a Title","type":"Image"},{"quality":{},"link":{},"data-anchor":{},"uri":"b25591_2790fd3a23db403793dbf2c3c1c62723~mv2_d_3000_1946_s_2.jpg","alt":"","width":3000,"height":1946,"id":"dataItem-jyn2gm9y","title":"Add a Title